cord here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids March to April came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. On the middle, 2025 ran 28% of normal in September to October 2025 and 10% in October to November 2025. In 2026 the middle swung the other way, with April to May at 191% of normal. Grid 10324 had its driest year in 1956 at 32% of normal.</p>"}
